    "not provided": "未提供",
    "Check housing assistance options": "查看住房援助选项",
    "Open DisasterAssistance.gov and review the assistance and application information for your situation.": "打开 DisasterAssistance.gov，查看针对您的情况的援助和申请信息。",
    "You asked for a place to stay. This is the official starting point for exploring federal assistance.": "您请求了住宿地点。这是探索联邦援助的官方起点。",
    "Check whether a recovery center is available": "检查是否有恢复中心可用",
    "Use the official locator. Confirm hours and services directly before traveling. A recovery center provides assistance information; it is not a shelter reservation.": "使用官方定位器。出行前请直接确认时间和服务。恢复中心提供援助信息；它不是避难所预订服务。",
    "A representative can help you understand housing-related assistance and other referrals.": "代表可以帮助您了解与住房相关的援助和其他转介。",
    "Prepare your housing questions": "准备您的住房问题",
    "Write down what you need to ask: which options may apply, what to prepare, and how to follow up. Keep private details for the official representative.": "写下您需要询问的问题：哪些选项可能适用、需要准备什么以及如何跟进。请将私人详细信息保留给官方代表。",
    "A short question list helps you explain your need without repeating your whole story.": "简短的问题列表可以帮助您说明需求，而无需重复讲述整个故事。",
    "Review assistance for basic needs": "查看基本需求援助",
    "Explore the official assistance information. This guide has not verified immediate food distribution or supplies in your locality.": "浏览官方援助信息。本指南未验证您所在地区的紧急食物分发或物资供应情况。",
