    "Ask a representative about available referrals": "向代表询问可用的转介",
    "Check the recovery center locator and confirm services before visiting. Ask which assistance or referrals may address your immediate needs.": "查看恢复中心定位器并在访问前确认服务。询问哪些援助或转介可能满足您的紧急需求。",
    "Availability varies. A representative can help you clarify which options to check directly.": "可用性各异。代表可以帮助您明确哪些选项需要直接查询。",
    "List the supplies you need to ask about": "列出您需要询问的物资",
    "Prepare a short list of your needs and questions about access and follow-up. Do not enter private medical or identifying details here.": "准备一份简短的需求和关于获取及后续问题的清单。请勿在此处输入私人医疗或身份详细信息。",
    "Specific questions make the conversation with a helper more useful.": "具体问题使与帮助者的交流更有成效。",
    "Review the official application route": "查看官方申请途径",
    "Use DisasterAssistance.gov to check application information and current options. The agency determines eligibility and whether an application is available.": "使用DisasterAssistance.gov查询申请信息和当前选项。机构将决定资格和申请是否可用。",
    "You reported property damage. The official application route explains how to ask for assistance.": "您报告了财产损失。官方申请途径说明如何申请援助。",
